        "TileImage": "$($repository 487278bb-d824-4a02-a8c5-0686e1ee8dd3).Image",
        "Description": "British Secret Service top spy Jamie Bont has betrayed his country by plotting to sell state secrets to Dalia Margolis. Bont has taken up the cover identity of Sir Humphrey Titus Rutherford and will be attending the IAGO Auction  tonight to offer Margolis the information he was privvy to due to his participation in the &apos;double 1 program&apos;.\r\rIf this information gets out active agents in deep cover will be put in serious danger. We&apos;re cleared to eliminate Bont by any means nessicary.\r\rGood Luck 47",
